# Docker stack

After changing the app, always bring the stack back up with a rebuild so running containers match the working tree:

```bash
docker compose up --build -d
```

Wait until the app is ready (entrypoint may install Chromium on first run, then Prisma migrate + Next.js). Do not skip `--build` for Next.js, Prisma, or Dockerfile changes; a plain restart serves the old image.

Chromium lives in the `playwright_browsers` volume and must not be re-downloaded on every image rebuild.
